# Onboarding & Couple Share

Source of truth: **`docs/onboarding-couple-share-flow.md`**.

## Must

- Gate app with `onboardingCompleted` before `MainTabView`.
- Paths: Create / Join / Solo — exactly as spec.
- Accept share → always show success/fail UI (`JoinResultView`). Never silent.
- Owner invite UI in onboarding + Settings; not Settings-only.
- Persist `myRole` explicitly; do not infer role only from shared-store presence for new users.
- UI tokens: padding 24, primary CTA height 52, progress bar height 4.

## Must not

- Don't reintroduce `UICloudSharingController` as primary invite UI.
- Don't auto-merge private + shared data without `ShareConflictView`.
- Don't mark onboarding complete before role is chosen on Join success path.
- Don't put onboarding state machine inside `ContentView`.

## Implement order

Use section 13 of the spec. Small PRs. Verify acceptance criteria in section 12.
